### Sanity Tests for Advice API
### Test these endpoints to verify the Advice API is working

### 1. Health Check
GET https://api.myjbfinanz.ch/healthz
Accept: application/json

### 2. Create/Update Advice Session
PUT https://api.myjbfinanz.ch/api/advice/test-123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "foo": "bar"
}

### 3. Get Advice Session
GET https://api.myjbfinanz.ch/api/advice/test-123
Accept: application/json

### 4. Generate PDF Summary
POST https://api.myjbfinanz.ch/api/advice/test-123/summary-pdf
Content-Type: application/json

### Expected Results:
### 1. GET /healthz → 200 { "ok": true, "ts": 1234567890 }
### 2. PUT /api/advice/test-123 → 204 No Content
### 3. GET /api/advice/test-123 → 200 { "meta": {...}, "foo": "bar" }
### 4. POST /api/advice/test-123/summary-pdf → 200 application/pdf
